{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00018",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.74,
      "end_seconds": 3.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Afternoon. Take the chair by the desk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.25,
      "end_seconds": 5.95,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.13,
      "end_seconds": 9.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "In your own words, what's happened?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.56,
      "end_seconds": 15.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Well, I've been having a tight band-like headache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.88,
      "end_seconds": 22.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "When did it begin? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.33,
      "end_seconds": 29.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "I'd say six months. Actually, no, closer to two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.77,
      "end_seconds": 38.13,
      "duration_seconds": 8.36,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.64,
      "end_seconds": 43.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "It's moderate, honestly. I'd say every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.0,
      "end_seconds": 47.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.47,
      "end_seconds": 57.81,
      "duration_seconds": 9.34,
      "text": "Irritability goes along with it, most of the time. The irritability? That's been for about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.74,
      "end_seconds": 63.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Did you get numbness or jaw pain when chewing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.0,
      "end_seconds": 69.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "No, no numbness or jaw pain when chewing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.02,
      "end_seconds": 73.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Did you get vomiting or blurred vision?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.41,
      "end_seconds": 77.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.05,
      "end_seconds": 81.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Okay, keep going. Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.75,
      "end_seconds": 85.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.39,
      "end_seconds": 88.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.75,
      "end_seconds": 91.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.87,
      "end_seconds": 97.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Is there a family history of anything significant?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.23,
      "end_seconds": 101.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "My father had a heart attack."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.83,
      "end_seconds": 104.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "What about operations, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.42,
      "end_seconds": 110.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Yes, I had a bypass operation, six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.61,
      "end_seconds": 128.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Right, any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.5,
      "end_seconds": 134.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "No allergies that I know of, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.68,
      "end_seconds": 154.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.63,
      "end_seconds": 167.16,
      "duration_seconds": 10.53,
      "text": "I've got high blood pressure. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. I've got heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.88,
      "end_seconds": 169.69,
      "duration_seconds": 0.81,
      "text": "Any others?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.1,
      "end_seconds": 174.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.68,
      "end_seconds": 187.17,
      "duration_seconds": 11.49,
      "text": "I take amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day. It's aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day. Paracetamol. I take it 500 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.72,
      "end_seconds": 189.69,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.78,
      "end_seconds": 193.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "I've never smoked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.34,
      "end_seconds": 200.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Anything special about your diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.37,
      "end_seconds": 205.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "I try to avoid too much sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.63,
      "end_seconds": 209.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "What's your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.04,
      "end_seconds": 214.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I teach at a primary school."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.09,
      "end_seconds": 217.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Are you active at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.21,
      "end_seconds": 226.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Barely, I'm mostly sedentary these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.38,
      "end_seconds": 232.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Let me examine, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.26,
      "end_seconds": 251.96,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.39,
      "end_seconds": 255.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Let me just check something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.49,
      "end_seconds": 269.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Your eye movements and reflexes are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.23,
      "end_seconds": 273.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Tell me if anything hurts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.1,
      "end_seconds": 295.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "The muscles at the back of your neck are tight and tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.11,
      "end_seconds": 315.0,
      "duration_seconds": 14.89,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit up. Having listened and examined, I think we're dealing with a tension-type headache at this stage. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.64,
      "end_seconds": 319.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.52,
      "end_seconds": 332.54,
      "duration_seconds": 11.02,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a tension-type headache, and we'll know more once the an eye check is back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 350.97,
      "end_seconds": 356.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "I want an eye check done, that's for headache and eye strain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.77,
      "end_seconds": 359.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.33,
      "end_seconds": 370.32,
      "duration_seconds": 8.99,
      "text": "The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 375.15,
      "end_seconds": 379.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Alright, I know what to look for."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.08,
      "end_seconds": 385.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "See me again in a month. Okay, do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 387.81,
      "end_seconds": 390.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Thank you for your time."
    }
  ]
}